-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §50 תקציב לקרן הלוואות: a further one-time
-- sum of 4 million shekels is allocated, by 31.12.2011, to the loan fund
-- set up under §יב of the collective agreement of 12.9.95.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `50 תקציב לקרן הלוואות`

-- ¶1: to the loan fund set up under §יב of the collective agreement of
-- 12.9.95 (a fund for teaching employees who are not State employees) a
-- further one-time sum of 4 million is allocated, by 31.12.2011 (the day
-- included: convention dates.end). "יוקצה" names no one to allocate it, so
-- the encoding writes no duty for it, as §33 writes none to install the
-- clock: what it states is the sum and the day.
@ref akn:art_50/p1
`the further sum section 50 allocates to the loan fund` MEANS 4_000_000

`the day section 50's sum is allocated by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011

GIVEN `allocated on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 50's sum is allocated in time` `allocated on` IF
    `allocated on` `is on or before` `the day section 50's sum is allocated by`

`why the loan fund's rules are not here` MEANS
    `not yet encoded` "סעיף יב. להסכם המיוחד (השלמה) מיום 12.9.1995, הלוואות לעובדי הוראה שאינם עובדי מדינה"

#ASSERT `section 50's sum is allocated in time` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011)
#ASSERT NOT `section 50's sum is allocated in time` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012)
